<div class="ayah-actions" role="group" aria-label="Ayah actions"><button type="button" id="ayah-views" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ayah-views-panel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 12s4-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-4 7-10 7S2 12 2 12Z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg><span id="ayah-view-count" translate="no">—</span><span>Views</span></button><button type="button" id="ayah-reflect" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="ayah-reflect-panel"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H8l-5 3V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5h8a5 5 0 0 1 5 5Z"/><path d="M7 7h10M7 11h7"/></svg><span>Reflections</span></button><button type="button" id="ayah-share"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="18" cy="4" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="12" r="3"/><circle cx="18" cy="20" r="3"/><path d="m9 10 6-4m-6 8 6 4"/></svg><span>Share</span></button></div>
<div class="ayah-action-panel" id="ayah-views-panel" hidden><p>Recorded views of this featured ayah, counted once per browser each UTC day. This is not a count of unique people.</p><button type="button" id="ayah-views-retry">Refresh views</button><p id="ayah-views-status" role="status"></p></div>
<div class="ayah-action-panel" id="ayah-reflect-panel" hidden><label for="ayah-reflection">Your personal reflection</label><p>These are your own study notes, not published tafsir. Saved only in this browser; clearing browser data removes them.</p><textarea id="ayah-reflection" rows="4" maxlength="5000" dir="auto" placeholder="Write your reflection on this ayah…"></textarea><div class="ayah-note-buttons"><button type="button" id="ayah-save">Save reflection</button><button type="button" id="ayah-delete">Delete reflection</button></div><p id="ayah-note-status" role="status"></p></div>
<div class="ayah-action-panel" id="ayah-share-panel" hidden><label for="ayah-share-url">Link to this ayah</label><input id="ayah-share-url" type="url" readonly dir="ltr"><p>Select and copy this link to share the ayah.</p></div><p class="ayah-action-status" id="ayah-share-status" role="status" hidden></p>
